Implemented one autonomous sprint.

Selected: Full-Stack MVP Sprint Sequence item 9, `US-095 CI local release validation workflow`, lane high-risk narrowed to a non-deploying CI proof slice, non-UI.

Changed:
- Added `.github/workflows/local-release-validation.yml`.
